 "remarks": "Welcome to this updated and move-in ready rental in sought-after Westport, offering a bright open layout and modern finishes throughout. The main level features a sun-filled living room with a fireplace, flowing seamlessly into the dining area and updated kitchen with granite counters, white cabinetry, and stainless appliances - ideal for everyday living and entertaining. The home offers three bedrooms and two full bathrooms, both updated with clean, modern finishes. Large windows throughout bring in excellent natural light, creating a warm and inviting feel in every room. The finished lower level provides valuable additional living space perfect for an additional living room, home office, or gym. Conveniently located near Westport's beaches, train station, shopping, dining, and commuter routes, this rental offers comfort, style, and location all in one.",
